   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO (Denmark) for Climate Change and Mitigation, Ocean science and gov</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO will:
&#x2022;	Assist in the formulation of a cross IOC position for Ocean Carbon;
&#x2022;	Assist in the development of international ocean observation and science and delivery of advice in areas of IOC expertise;
&#x2022;	Participate in the development, implementation and evaluation of assigned projects and provide input and support in preparation of related inputs to key meetings and events. 
&#x2022;	Assist to develop, plan and implement relevant communication materials and outreach in relation to climate change mitigation and adaptation;
&#x2022;	Follow, survey and interact with relevant Ocean Decade initiatives and programmes related to ocean carbon.</narrative>
  </description>
